§ `Definitions that sit inside later sections`

-- s 729(2): "In this section, analyst means a person designated as an analyst under the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act or the Cannabis Act."
-- src:15452 | Definition of analyst
-- src:15453 | (2) In this section, analyst means a person designated as an analyst under the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act or the Cannabis Act.
@ref s 729(2) (src:15452-15453)
GIVEN `the person is designated as an analyst under the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is designated as an analyst under the Cannabis Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 729(2) analyst` MEANS
    IF `the person is designated as an analyst under the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act` OR `the person is designated as an analyst under the Cannabis Act`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "analyst means a person designated as an analyst under the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act or the Cannabis Act"

-- s 729.1(2): "analyst has the same meaning as in section 320.11": the answer of section 320.11 (part ccc11) is an input.
-- src:15461 | Definition of analyst
-- src:15462 | (2) In this section, analyst has the same meaning as in section 320.11.
@ref s 729.1(2) (src:15461-15462)
GIVEN `s 320.11 the person is an analyst` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 729.1(2) analyst` MEANS `s 320.11 the person is an analyst`   -- JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING exactly as section 320.11 answers

-- s 732.1(1): the two defined terms.
-- src:15517 | Definitions
-- src:15518 | 732.1 (1) In this section and section 732.2,
-- src:15519 | change, in relation to optional conditions, includes deletions and additions; (modification)
@ref s 732.1(1) "change" (src:15517-15519)
DECLARE `s 732.1(1) what the change is` IS ONE OF
    `s 732.1(1) a deletion of an optional condition`
    `s 732.1(1) an addition of an optional condition`
    `s 732.1(1) an alteration that is neither a deletion nor an addition`

@ref s 732.1(1) "change" (src:15519)
GIVEN what IS A `s 732.1(1) what the change is`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 732.1(1) change, in relation to optional conditions` MEANS
    CONSIDER what
    WHEN `s 732.1(1) a deletion of an optional condition` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 732.1(1) an addition of an optional condition` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 732.1(1) an alteration that is neither a deletion nor an addition` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "change, in relation to optional conditions, includes deletions and additions"

-- src:15520 | optional conditions means the conditions referred to in subsection (3) or (3.1). (conditions facultatives)
@ref s 732.1(1) "optional conditions" (src:15520)
GIVEN `the condition is one referred to in subsection 732.1(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the condition is one referred to in subsection 732.1(3.1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 732.1(1) optional conditions` MEANS
    IF `the condition is one referred to in subsection 732.1(3)` OR `the condition is one referred to in subsection 732.1(3.1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "optional conditions means the conditions referred to in subsection (3) or (3.1)"

-- s 734.8(1): "penalty means the aggregate of (a) the fine, and (b) the costs and charges of committing and conveying the defaulter to prison,
-- calculated in accordance with regulations made under subsection 734(7)". Dollars. The costs and charges are an input (they are calculated
-- by provincial regulations, outside the text).
-- src:15734 | Definition of penalty
-- src:15735 | 734.8 (1) In this section, penalty means the aggregate of
-- src:15736 | (a) the fine, and
-- src:15737 | (b) the costs and charges of committing and conveying the defaulter to prison, calculated in accordance with regulations made under subsection 734(7).
@ref s 734.8(1) (src:15734-15737)
GIVEN fine IS A NUMBER
      `the costs and charges of committing and conveying the defaulter to prison, calculated in accordance with regulations made under subsection 734(7)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 734.8(1) penalty` MEANS
    fine PLUS `the costs and charges of committing and conveying the defaulter to prison, calculated in accordance with regulations made under subsection 734(7)`

-- The answer ss 737 and 738 (part ccc27) ask for, typed as the core's `Fine` (PLAN.md section 6, "other parts ask this part"): the penalty as a fine of that amount.
@ref s 734.8(1) (src:15735-15737)
GIVEN fine IS A NUMBER
      `the costs and charges of committing and conveying the defaulter to prison, calculated in accordance with regulations made under subsection 734(7)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Fine
`s 734.8 the fine and its penalty` MEANS
    `a fine of` (`s 734.8(1) penalty` fine `the costs and charges of committing and conveying the defaulter to prison, calculated in accordance with regulations made under subsection 734(7)`)
